      "title": "Write authority",
      "items": [
        "Every authoritative mutation checks the active attempt/fence.",
        "An expired worker cannot publish late success or failure."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Accounting",
      "items": [
        "Unknown provider outcomes remain conservatively charged.",
        "Retries share limits and cannot create fresh free budget."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Recovery",
      "items": [
        "Persist leases and state in PostgreSQL.",
        "Process-loss and real lock contention need integration checks."
      ]
    }
